{"ocrText": "V.  I.  LENIN\n50\nYou must choose the one or the other. Tsereteli, Chernov\nand the rest prefer a middle course. But there is no middle\ncourse. If they vacillate or try to get away with mere talk,\nthey, Tsereteli, Chernov and the rest, will completely make\nthemselves tools in the hands of the counter-revolutionary\nbourgeoisie.\nPravda  No.  74,\nPublished  according  to\nJune  19  (6),  1917\nthe  Pravda  text", "textLayer": [{"text": "V.  I.  LENIN", "x": 44.62, "y": 6.11, "w": 13.0, "h": 1.35, "fontSize": 8.0}, {"text": "50", "x": 11.11, "y": 6.06, "w": 2.39, "h": 1.56, "fontSize": 9.2}, {"text": "You must choose the one or the other. Tsereteli, Chernov", "x": 13.9, "y": 9.53, "w": 77.22, "h": 1.85, "fontSize": 11.0}, {"text": "and the rest prefer a middle course. But there is no middle", "x": 11.11, "y": 11.47, "w": 80.01, "h": 1.85, "fontSize": 11.0}, {"text": "course. If they vacillate or try to get away with mere talk,", "x": 11.11, "y": 13.39, "w": 80.01, "h": 1.85, "fontSize": 11.0}, {"text": "they, Tsereteli, Chernov and the rest, will completely make", "x": 11.11, "y": 15.33, "w": 80.01, "h": 1.85, "fontSize": 11.0}, {"text": "themselves tools in the hands of the counter-revolutionary", "x": 11.11, "y": 17.27, "w": 80.0, "h": 1.85, "fontSize": 11.0}, {"text": "bourgeoisie.", "x": 11.11, "y": 19.2, "w": 15.78, "h": 1.85, "fontSize": 11.0}, {"text": "Pravda", "x": 11.94, "y": 23.09, "w": 7.16, "h": 1.35, "fontSize": 8.0}, {"text": "No.", "x": 20.0, "y": 23.08, "w": 3.23, "h": 1.35, "fontSize": 8.0}, {"text": "74", "x": 24.15, "y": 23.13, "w": 2.01, "h": 1.28, "fontSize": 7.6}, {"text": ",", "x": 26.4, "y": 23.08, "w": 0.53, "h": 1.35, "fontSize": 8.0}, {"text": "Published", "x": 68.24, "y": 23.08, "w": 9.43, "h": 1.35, "fontSize": 8.0}, {"text": "according", "x": 78.58, "y": 23.08, "w": 9.36, "h": 1.35, "fontSize": 8.0}, {"text": "to", "x": 88.83, "y": 23.08, "w": 1.82, "h": 1.35, "fontSize": 8.0}, {"text": "June", "x": 11.17, "y": 24.43, "